  m_Name: MIDCousin_m5_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: Anyways...
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2071a3956799eac499fe06278e1f69e1, type: 3}
    AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 3230480644210021281, guid: 21a34e576288bf148b0d7294986f3034, type: 3}
    AudioResponse: Neutral
    HasAdvancedSignal: 0
    AdvancedSignal: 0
  - Dialogue: I know we weren't, like, SUPER close or anything.
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2071a3956799eac499fe06278e1f69e1, type: 3}
    AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 3230480644210021281, guid: 21a34e576288bf148b0d7294986f3034, type: 3}
    AudioResponse: Neutral
    HasAdvancedSignal: 0
    AdvancedSignal: 0
  - Dialogue: I can only imagine how much of a bother I was back in the day.
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6506522cd75f2404d91e8fb4738abf28, type: 3}
    AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
    AudioResponse: Sad
    HasAdvancedSignal: 0
    AdvancedSignal: 0
  - Dialogue: I mean, seriously, spoiling and even OPENING your birthday present?
      That still haunts me to this day, honestly.
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bf08644dbaefc5a4ba15ddce9653347b, type: 3}
    AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 3230480644210021281, guid: 21a34e576288bf148b0d7294986f3034, type: 3}
    AudioResponse: Happy
    HasAdvancedSignal: 0
    AdvancedSignal: 0
  - Dialogue: But... it wasn't all bad... We still had some good times.
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2071a3956799eac499fe06278e1f69e1, type: 3}
    AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
    AudioResponse: Neutral
    HasAdvancedSignal: 0
    AdvancedSignal: 0
  - Dialogue: ...Right?
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6506522cd75f2404d91e8fb4738abf28, type: 3}
    AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 3230480644210021281, guid: 21a34e576288bf148b0d7294986f3034, type: 3}
    AudioResponse: Silent
    HasAdvancedSignal: 0
    AdvancedSignal: 0
  - Dialogue: ...Sorry, I still talk too much, I think. Have fun at school, seriously.
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bf08644dbaefc5a4ba15ddce9653347b, type: 3}
    AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 1732592836512686072, guid: ef44ce4f2cc40dd43933e177fba7a7ef, type: 3}
    AudioResponse: Happy
    HasAdvancedSignal: 0
    AdvancedSignal: 0
